# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.
#
# This is the ONLY variable the project reads. There is no API key, no model
# provider and no account of any kind: every figure is computed by
# deterministic code from the committed captures in data/raw/, so a fresh
# clone reproduces all fifteen propositions with no credentials and no
# network (`npm run verify:offline`). See docs/MODEL_CARD.md.
#
# Any long random string. Signs the per-metric JWS receipts (HS256).
# Leave it unset and everything still computes and verifies — receipts simply
# ship empty and the run says so rather than passing silently.
MANDATE_SIGNING_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string
